<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><h2 class="sec-title">The plumbing we do.</h2><p class="lead">From a blocked drain at midnight to a full hot water replacement &mdash; one licensed team for the whole job.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid"><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Blocked drains</h3><p>Drains cleared with the right gear &mdash; jetted, cabled and camera-checked so the blockage is actually gone.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Hot water</h3><p>Hot water systems repaired, replaced and installed &mdash; electric, gas and heat pump, back on the same day where we can.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Pipe relining</h3><p>Cracked and root-invaded pipes relined from the inside &mdash; no digging up the yard or the slab.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Leaks &amp; repairs</h3><p>Leaks in walls, under slabs and at fittings found, exposed and repaired properly.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">05</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Gas fitting</h3><p>Gas lines, appliances and leak checks by a licensed gas fitter &mdash; safe and certified.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">06</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Meters, RPZ &amp; upgrades</h3><p>Water meters, backflow (RPZ) valves and plumbing upgrades for homes and businesses.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><h2 class="sec-title">How a callout runs.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps"><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Call us</h3><p>Tell us what is happening &mdash; we will tell you what to do before we arrive.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Upfront quote</h3><p>Diagnosed on site and priced before any work starts &mdash; no surprises.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Fixed right</h3><p>The job done with the right parts and gear, tested before we leave.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Tested &amp; tidied</h3><p>System tested, area cleaned and the fix explained.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every callout.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you do emergency callouts?</summary><div class="a">Yes &mdash; 24/7 emergency response for blocked drains, burst pipes and no-hot-water.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you charge before quoting?</summary><div class="a">No &mdash; we give you an upfront price before any work begins.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Can you reline a pipe without digging?</summary><div class="a">Yes &mdash; pipe relining repairs damaged pipes from the inside, so there is no trench in the yard.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Are you licensed and insured?</summary><div class="a">Yes &mdash; licensed plumbers and gas fitters, fully insured, across Sydney.</div></details>
</div></section>

