<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><h2 class="rv d1">On the tools.</h2><p class="lead rv d2">Real plumbing jobs across Sydney &mdash; drains, hot water, relining and repairs.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="hgal rv"><div class="track"><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_3.jpg" alt="In-wall tap rough-in — H2O Plumbing Sydney" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>In-wall tap rough-in</span><span class="mono">/01</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_2.jpg" alt="Manifold &amp; valve replacement — H2O Plumbing Sydney" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Manifold &amp; valve replacement</span><span class="mono">/02</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/why.jpg" alt="Hot water cylinder &mdash; full install — H2O Plumbing Sydney" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Hot water cylinder &mdash; full install</span><span class="mono">/03</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_5.jpg" alt="Pool filter &amp; valve — H2O Plumbing Sydney" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Pool filter &amp; valve</span><span class="mono">/04</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_1.jpg" alt="Blocked drain &mdash; cleared — H2O Plumbing Sydney" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Blocked drain &mdash; cleared</span><span class="mono">/05</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>
